<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-constant">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`PERMISSION_SILENT_ESTATE_MANAGEMENT: number = 16384`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer PERMISSION_SILENT_ESTATE_MANAGEMENT = 16384;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant PERMISSION_SILENT_ESTATE_MANAGEMENT has the value 0x4000</p>
  <p>A script with this permission does not notify the object owner when it modifies estate access rules via <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlManageEstateAccess" target="_blank">llManageEstateAccess</a>.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Member Of</div>
